  "body": "Compose corrected facet filtering/receipt replay with evidence-bearing variable identities and the reviewed PR-086 current-input continuation. Historical failures and source/assignment provenance are retained so the joint candidate can receive hosted validation before component acceptance.\n\n- Assignments: PR-006 (P1/1B, R01/R02, F04/F17/F24), PR-008 (P1/1C, R02/R05, F10/F11/F12), and the already reviewed PR-086 continuation. Controller/reviewer: Astra; a separate native reviewer checked controller-authored metadata.\n- Base branch: `codex/research-program-integration-20260910`, published SHA `9e00d4e09514e1dd30672e19a3cbef4171955b00`. Local integration checkpoint `7c7ad7f9577507fc294438025ec8c60145e8cb33` is already an ancestor of this candidate; no separate base push is needed.\n- Exact head: `954a237a8984d06f5ea0ab15f83c71ce210bf09a`; tree `a781e9801224af92b51389fb898f0b67ab261982`; branch `codex/ushso-pr006-pr008-combined-20260911`.\n- Final producer heads: PR-006 `a153a3d5e734fee17d9016b8d36b0f94006f24fe`; PR-008 `09e312c9fb8767656ba6f6dcb0f996510098842d`. Original bases and dependency merge SHAs are preserved in their handoffs.\n- [PR-006 handoff](https://github.com/ajhcs/ushso/blob/954a237a8984d06f5ea0ab15f83c71ce210bf09a/docs/research-program/handoffs/PR-006.json); [PR-008 handoff](https://github.com/ajhcs/ushso/blob/954a237a8984d06f5ea0ab15f83c71ce210bf09a/docs/research-program/handoffs/PR-008.json); [Composition and retained-history manifest](https://github.com/ajhcs/ushso/blob/954a237a8984d06f5ea0ab15f83c71ce210bf09a/verification/research-program/bootstrap/astra-takeover-20260912/final-composition/composition.json).\n- Verification on this head: component handoff validators pass; separate metadata review reports 49 initial and 39 final integrity checks with no actionable findings; 23 custom regression probes and 12 actual Chrome cases pass. These final receipts are retained locally and await a durable publication link.\n- New local release gate: **passed all 10 stages on the first attempt**, with exactly one repository build, on this head and tree at 2026-09-12 04:13:59 UTC (514 seconds). This includes the full test suite, local end-to-end checks, release audit, Cloudflare dry run and retained deployable artifacts. Receipt run: `20260912T040526Z-9d0ca8f43f35`; the exact receipt and stage logs are retained locally for the acceptance capsule. Hosted `node22-compatibility` and `build-and-dry-run`: **pending**. Earlier `e3af8dd` results remain historical.\n- Payload review: every new reachable commit/blob was scanned, including gzip contents; eight retained screenshots contain synthetic/public catalog UI. Four scanner hits were non-secret gate identity hashes. The evidence includes host paths and internal task identifiers as provenance, but no credential values, PHI, production environment contents or private evaluation inputs were found. No generated distribution, dependency directory or bulk corpus rows were added.\n- Compatibility: the 3434/3430/4 corpus partition, frozen cohorts/contracts and typed uncertainty/access boundaries are preserved. No production configuration or routes change; reverting the eventual merge would remove this component bundle.\n- Current state: draft, awaiting exact combined hosted CI and controller acceptance. Individual draft CI results do not qualify the joint composition. Main PR #12 stays draft; all R01\u2013R16, PR-009, release qualification and deployment remain unaccepted.\n",
